OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters rescue horse stuck in
OL,4,Amud on farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters rescued a horse from a
OL,7,Fditch after it became stuck in deep mud
OL,8,Fin Nottinghamshire.
OL,10,FThe Cob horse Arna is believed to have
OL,11,Fgot into difficulty after venturing
OL,12,Finto the mud to eat reeds at a farm
OL,13,Fwhere she is kept in Newark between
OL,14,Flate Sunday evening and Monday morning.
OL,16,FFour fire crews were called to the
OL,17,Fscene at 13:40 BST on Monday to reports
OL,18,Fof a large animal in need of rescuing.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
